{"server":"tw","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_08_end","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_08","title":"黃沙盡頭","storyCode":"AS-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"ee75f6336aa3aa078c4463b6bbe09a09e5794c8ff33bb93898f390785f22048a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_falls_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是什麼地方啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瀑布？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"瀑布邊，佩佩看見方才那個男孩正垂著頭，清洗著什麼。\n她快步上前，想要喚起男孩的注意，卻發現他長高了點，臉龐已經褪去了孩童的稚嫩。\n現在的他，已經是個少年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，夠了，不管你是誰！讓我離開……你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷了嗎？你的臉上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，不用擔心，這些血大多是敵人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰場上的情況比我想像中的要複雜，但他們都不是我的對手，我贏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾，在阿爾薩蘭的雨林中，我為你在神廟裡祈求了一副護身符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我希望它能保護你不受傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕，姐姐，那些傷痕都是我成長的證明。"},{"type":"narration","text":"低下頭，佩佩看見半跪著的少年的膝旁，橫放著一柄長劍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾道鮮紅的血液順著劍身流入潭水中，將水面染成粉紅一片。\n佩佩轉頭，看見背後的少女嘴角噙著溫柔的笑意，但眼中卻顯露出擔憂。\n她將頭扭回，卻發現四周場景再次變換。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨林中，少年舉起一把匕首，翻轉著，打量個不停。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你，從明天開始，就要統領父親的衛戍部隊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是你夢寐以求的職位，為什麼你看起來一點也不開心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道，與我付出的努力與艱辛相比，這把指揮官匕首實在是有些太輕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，姐姐？你不為我高興嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，祖拜爾，只有你開心，我才會高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些書卷，你已經在上面花費了無數個日夜。有找到什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾，薩爾貢的歷史遠比我們想像的更為悠久，但現存的抄本與記錄都沒有完整地將它們記述下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我打算編撰一部史籍，記錄下那些被遺漏的前代事蹟，最好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最好它能將薩爾貢的歷史完整地記述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"篇幅一定很長……你要寫的人一定很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父親認可了我的想法，他承諾會為我提供幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的少年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1481_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我們都得到了自己想要的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"佩佩看到少年將匕首收回，對著姐姐露出笑容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外一個地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是什麼時候……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你為何愁眉不展……祖拜爾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位來自東方的庫蘭塔，他讓父親變得不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年，各個部族的叛亂與挑戰都不能讓父親面容改色，一次又一次，他重整隊伍，揚起旗幟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當父親用長劍劈砍面前的敵人，那些自他們脖頸處濺射而出的血液，也不能讓他面具後的冰冷目光融化分毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位夢魘……當父親與他戰鬥的時候，兵器相接，所擊出的火花點燃了父親瞳孔中的火焰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未見過他如此狂熱地注視一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾，我能夠察覺到……我們的父親，他付諸國家的熱情早已減退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到了一些令人忐忑的消息，父親他打算邀請哈蘭杜汗一同揮師南下，去挑戰那裡的無形之敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也要去，對嗎，祖拜爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那些怪誕的敵人已經在一步步侵蝕我們的土地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙阿……你們都是沙阿的孩子……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"跟著青年的視線向遠處眺望，忽然間，千里之外的土地被一股引力拉至眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"佩佩看到了一片寸草不生的荒漠，風中夾著沙粒，打在她的眼皮上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……焚風熱土……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾，你感覺怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我現在為你換藥，需要打開你身上的繃帶，忍耐一下，很快就結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不痛，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會不痛呢，你被抬回來的時候，渾身焦黑，沒有一塊皮膚是完好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我該怎麼辦，祖拜爾……父親不知所蹤，你是我最後的親人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王兄已經即位，我們與他並非一母同出，你在軍中立下的功績已經讓他有所忌憚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位史官先生……他對你好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……有他幫忙，那本史籍的編撰已近一半，或許在我有生之年，能有機會見到它的完本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不該太過操勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我對父親的承諾……就算我完成不了，我腹中的孩子也會繼續……終有一日，它會告訴後來人，此時此刻所發生的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它會隔著遙遠的時光，架起一座橋樑，讓讀者與所記錄的人物在漫漫歷史長河中彼此相認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，他們要為父親修建一座衣冠塚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親在離開前，將那座藏滿世間珍奇的寶庫地址告訴了我，他讓我等待夢魘的後裔，將其中的一切盡數給予他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王兄知道了會不高興的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你選擇了用筆記下父親的一言一行來緬懷他的離去，而我選擇守護他留下的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親才剛剛離開，西南各個部族便又升起烽煙……總要有人去平定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣……你這樣要怎麼去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位來自阿爾薩蘭的寶石匠人告訴我，他可以透過篆刻特殊迴路的寶石保留我的意識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而製作長生軍的工匠們也願意為我打造另一副軀殼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是做好決定才告訴我的嗎，祖拜爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我不想永遠躺在床上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾，我只想你能快樂，除此之外，別無所求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"答應我你會永遠記得這句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安靜的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_1480_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我答應你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我……我在哪裡？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（好黑……有人嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（為、為什麼說不出話？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（可惡，根本沒辦法動彈，有人綁住了我的手腳。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"準備好了嗎？我要將他的大腦取出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（大腦？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再來點麻醉藥劑，我監測到他的脈搏還是跳得很快，我需要讓他平靜下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（你們要取出誰的腦子！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"面前的遮擋物被拿開，光線從外界進入，佩佩發現自己此刻正躺在一座石台中央。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"周圍的人來來往往，不斷往她的身體上塗抹刺鼻的黏稠藥物，還用浸濕的麻布條將她裹緊，這便是她一直無法活動的原因。\n還來不及繼續觀察，佩佩便看到一位老者手持細長的小刀向自己走來，本應陷入慌張的她卻因為藥物的作用而逐漸安定。\n她感覺到頭顱被人按住，刀刃緩緩抵向額心……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（這是祖拜爾的經歷嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（原來被提取意識的時候……他還活著。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結束了嗎？這些就是你想為我展示的嗎，祖拜爾？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，後來你又經歷了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這樣等候了近千年的時光嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾，告訴我，在你漫長的一生中，儘管痛苦難忍，但你是否有過那麼一刻，想要忘記自己的姐姐、自己的父親？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是我的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不該遺忘，那就記住，即便會帶來痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有巨大的凶獸，沒有潮濕的雨林，沒有灼熱的風沙。\n街道正中，只有一隻小動物蹲在那裡，輕輕舔舐自己的皮毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要將我帶入祖拜爾的記憶之中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是祖拜爾為你設下的考驗，只有通過了，你才能見到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，在幻境之中，與我對答的人是他嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那其實是我，但問題確實是他為你預設下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我通過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你失敗了，從哪裡來的就滾回哪裡去吧，小丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他在幻境裡不還對我的回答蠻滿意的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，都是你的錯覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須見到他，城市中的騷亂因他而起，只有他才能停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況……要進入黃金之城，只有他能幫我達成，我不想放棄這最後的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢丫頭，你以為去黃金之城做史官是什麼好差事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為要隨侍在王者身側，為了確保祕密不被洩露，他們都會被割去舌頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所記述的，不過是萬王之王希望你記述的，從此你不再是自己，不過是王者的喉舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的願意嗎，蠢丫頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些你又是從哪裡知道的？黃金之城可不是隨便一隻動物就能去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢丫頭，我飼養的第一隻小人類可是路加薩爾古斯的小女兒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我親眼目睹那個可憐的女孩被自己的哥哥割掉了舌頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，米奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她已經通過了祖拜爾的考驗，放她過去，不要多言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在第三條小巷往裡走倒數第二間民居中等你，記住，進去後先敲三下左邊的門，然後直接推開右邊的門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就會見到他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這混蛋，她沒有通過考驗，你憑什麼要說出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已經通過考驗了，米奧，不要再胡攪蠻纏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒過！我說沒過就沒過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢貨，你難道要看這丫頭變成……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放開我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的任務已經完成了！快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"銜住米奧的後脖頸，沃奧將牠拖進巷口，留給佩佩的只有一道塵土中的拖痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……第三條小巷裡倒數第二間民居……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先敲三下左邊的門……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後直接推開右邊的門……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又見面了，佩佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有個問題，如果我不照那隻動物說的，先敲門再推門，我還能見到你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實隨便你推開哪扇門都能夠見到我，重點是你到底想不想見我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜爾，我是帶著錘子來找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算使用武力脅迫我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不保證不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間不多了，我問你答，不要欺騙我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你問吧，佩佩，我會坦誠以待。但我並非因為你的恐嚇而屈服，我回答只是因為我願意回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經找到第四顆寶石了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，有人一直為我保管著這顆寶石，其家族代代相傳，就是為了等待某天我甦醒，將其奉還。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一拿到它就決定毀掉整座城市嗎？外面已經因為寶石構裝體亂做一團了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩佩，城市中發生的事情我很抱歉，但我必須那麼做，這是我的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“第四顆代表肝臟，我們清醒著進入夜晚，為了職責與義務。”有關你職責的記憶終於完整了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沙阿的寶庫到底在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在我們腳下，就在米納特哈瑪儀這座城市的下方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以說，這座城市的建立、富饒與興盛都要仰仗父親所留下的無盡寶藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親離去後，我將他的衣冠塚修建在他的寶庫最深處，這間寶庫亦是他的陵寢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數百年的時間裡，他們不停向地底發掘，在陵寢中獲得的每一件文物與珍寶都化作了供養這座城市的養分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的失職，但現在還不晚，尚有挽救的機會，他們還沒有挖掘到最深處的……那些絕不容他人染指的珍寶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那到底是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別著急，佩佩，這正是我想要展示給你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一束陽光從窗外射入，打在祖拜爾的腳邊。\n祖拜爾高高舉起手杖，上端的叉鈴被不知從何而起的狂風捲動，發出清脆悠揚的鈴聲。\n伴著鈴響，佩佩聽見祖拜爾哼起一首旋律莫名熟悉的歌謠，但歌詞卻晦澀難懂。\n隨即，女孩感覺到自己腳下堅實的土地變得柔軟，彷彿流動的沙地，她的腳踝早已深陷其中。\n當祖拜爾的歌聲行至結尾，他便將手杖重重扎進地面。\n不過瞬間，沙塵四散揚起，沒去了二人的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g5_museum"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水！拿水來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點！你們的阿娜特館長逞強說了太多話，現在中暑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"壞消息——博物館停水很久了，梅捷緹克緹女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確來說，所有的水龍頭現在都在往外流沙子，關都關不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你是博物館的員工嗎？我看你有點陌生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等，所有的水龍頭……只有沙子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。順帶一提，這是我們抵達的時候，你們的員工讓我轉交的一張請假條，還有一堆書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道他想去哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"河水現在十分渾濁，無法取用，附近的淨水渠也被黃沙填滿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都是剛剛我們趕過來的路上發生的事，快得就像洪水漲起來漫過堤岸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，漫灌節，只不過漫出來的是沙子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嘿，女士？你怎麼不說話？有這麼不好笑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿娜特，阿娜特，快醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我們……我們要死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天發生了這麼多事情，你到現在才反應過來要死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯帕齊婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1477_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅捷緹克緹女士，能請你具體說一下情況嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡單來說，如果全城所有的寶石都可能被拆除，那麼河道中用於淨水的寶石也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大量寶石被拆掉了，就會導致淨水系統停轉，壓力變化，黃沙倒灌……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這樣一來，寶石構裝體就有源源不斷的材料，能壘起石柱與高牆，破壞城市現在的樣貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，緹緹，我擔心還有更糟糕的情況……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿娜特","speakerId":"avg_4139_papyrs_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼突然的壓力變化，會導致古代的地下河道工程受損。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我本來不想說出來的，阿娜特，我怕說出來就變成真的！我現在真的害怕這座城市了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，地下河道受損，然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大量的水分滲透會使這一帶的砂土變得鬆軟，形成流沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整座城市會沉降，構裝體所不能消化的現代材料將埋入黃沙深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上我的一點推測……構裝體並非平白無故在街道上建起立柱與高牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們在復原自己記憶中這裡的景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們所有人，連帶數百年城市文明的痕跡，都會被埋回黃沙之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷緹克緹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……需要我解釋得更清楚一點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我完全懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市如果被沙子淹沒，我們都會死，你們會死，我的手下也會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜仁圖亞","speakerId":"avg_4138_narant_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，為了保護我的手下，我是不是只有一條路可以走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
